## Original Content
Plus grand salon européen du jeu vidéo, la Gamescom réunit cette année à Cologne plus de 1600 exposants et doit présenter plus de 800 jeux.

## Summary
The article announces the opening of Gamescom 2026, the largest European video game fair, in Cologne. It will feature over 1600 exhibitors and showcase more than 800 games, with highlights including Final Fantasy VII Revelation and the return of The Witcher 3.

## Key Points
- Gamescom 2026 is the largest European video game fair.
- The event will be held in Cologne with over 1600 exhibitors participating.
- More than 800 games will be presented at the fair.
- Final Fantasy VII Revelation and The Witcher 3 are key featured games.


